# A container's member answer types are reached only through the members
# written C calls: this Map String String is only set and asked `has`, so the
# option its `get` answers and the one its `remove` answers are not written.
main: function is {
    m: (Map String V: String)
    m.set key: "a".string value: "1".string
    if (m.has key: "a".string) then print "has a"
    print "\{m.length}"
}
